OL,3,GNEWSATeenage e-scooter rider dies in
OL,4,Acrash with van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has died after a
OL,7,Fcrash involving the e-scooter he was
OL,8,Friding and a van.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to Moor Lane in North Hykeham
OL,12,Fwhere a collision involving the
OL,13,Felectronic scooter and a red Ford
OL,14,FTransit van happened at about 17:40 BST
OL,15,Fon Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
