OL,3,GNEWSATeenage e-scooter rider dies in
OL,4,Acrash with van
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the teenager's family
OL,7,Fwas being supported by specially
OL,8,Ftrained officers. "Our thoughts are
OL,9,Fwith his family and friends at this
OL,10,Fincredibly difficult time, and we know
OL,11,Fmany others in the local community will
OL,12,Fmourn his loss," it added.
OL,14,FPolice urged anyone who witnessed the
OL,15,Fcollision or had dashcam footage to get
OL,16,Fin touch.
